<body>
<img src="/images/product-design-process.png" alt="" style="max-width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">

<p>thanks so much for the feedback 💖🎀 (⁠◕⁠ᴗ⁠◕⁠✿⁠) truly, from the bottom of my little designer heart 🥹✨💕 i love feedback 🌸 i cherish feedback 🐰💗 i collect feedback the way a squirrel collects acorns for winter 🐿️🌰🎀 every single piece of it is precious to me 💎✨ (⁠つ⁠≧⁠▽⁠≦⁠)⁠つ</p>

<p>so first things first!! ✋🌷 I will file this right away 📝🎀 filing an issue is such a quick and cozy way 🏠💕 to make sure your feedback doesn't slip through the cracks 🐣✨ not one single crumb of it 🍪🚫 it goes straight into our little treasure chest of user insights 🧰💖 where it will be kept safe and warm 🔥🧸 until we revisit these flows 🌊🎀 and revisit them we WILL 💪🌸 (⁠◕⁠‿⁠◕⁠)</p>

<p>and i want to be super duper extra clear about something 🥺👉👈✨ we are SO willing to adjust and change flows based on user feedback 🔄💖🎀 we are not attached to our current flows 🙅‍♀️🌸 not even a little bit 🤏💕 no matter how intentional they are 💭🎀 and believe me, they are VERY intentional 🧐✍️✨ every pixel placed with purpose 📐💖 every interaction lovingly considered 🫶🌷 but intentionality is not attachment 🧘‍♀️✨ we hold our designs gently, like a baby bird 🐥💗 ready to let them fly away and become something better 🕊️🌈🎀</p>

<p>because here's the thing 💡✨ for a designer 👩‍🎨🎀 unlike for an engineer 👷‍♂️🔧 feedback does not constitute a pivot 🚫🔀 it doesn't mean abandoning ship 🚢💨 or starting over from scratch 📄✂️ nooo no no 🙅‍♀️💕 feedback just helps us paint a clearer picture 🖼️🌈✨ it adds little brushstrokes of truth 🖌️💖 to the canvas of understanding 🎨🌸 and we use that picture to make improvements that are deeply user-centric 🫶💕 and empathetic 🥹💞 because we love our users 😍🎀 we LOVE them 💝💝💝 (⁠♡⁠˙⁠︶⁠˙⁠♡⁠)</p>

<p>but ALSO!! ✋🌟 and this is important 📢🎀 we exist at the nexus 🌀✨ of the product's direction 🧭💫 we sit right at that magical intersection 🚦💖 where user needs meet product vision 🤝🌈 and we will always, always incorporate that as a key part of our design execution 🗝️🎨💕 it's a delicate dance 💃🎀 a beautiful balancing act 🎪✨ and we do it with joy in our hearts 💗🌸</p>

<p>it's all about pushing and pulling the product 🤲💖 into new directions 🧭🎀 kneading it like a good dough 🥐👩‍🍳✨ folding it over 🙌 letting it rest 😴💤 letting it rise 🌅🍞 giving it lots and lots of love 💝💝💝 continuing to refine flows 🌊🎀 smoothing every rough edge 🧸💕 rounding every sharp corner ⭕💗 and continuing to distill the product into its purest, most essential form ⚗️🌸 like making a nice syrup 🍯🥞✨ you simmer it down 🍲🔥 slowly, patiently 🐢💕 until only the sweetest, most concentrated goodness remains 🍬🎀 because good design is reductive ✂️✨ (⁠ ⁠´⁠꒳⁠`⁠) we make the core functions as easy as possible 🍃😌💖 as light as a feather 🪶🌸 as smooth as butter 🧈✨ while still keeping those deep, powerful features tucked away for our beloved power users 🦸‍♀️⚡🎀 they deserve their secret garden too 🌺🗝️💕</p>

<p>but ALSO also!! 🌟🎀 we must never stop exploring 🗺️🔭✨ the design of this app brings up so many novel problems 🧩💖 strange and wonderful puzzles 🎲🌈 that no one has ever solved before 🏔️✨ and finding the ideal solution requires bravery 🦁💕 and curiosity 🐱🎀 and wandering off the beaten path sometimes 🌲🥾🌸</p>

<p>so we diverge and we converge 🎢🎯✨ we open up like a flower 🌸🌺🌻 exploring every direction 🦋🌈 and then we gather it all back in 🧺💖 converge the app more than it diverges 🌪️➡️🎀 always tightening, always focusing 🔍💕 but still diverging 🦋✨ still dreaming 💭🌙 still exploring 🚀🌸</p>

<p>be not afraid of change 🌱💪💕<br>
believe in design 🙏🎨✨<br>
trust the process 🌀🎀<br>
love your users 🫶💖<br>
knead the dough 🥐👩‍🍳<br>
simmer the syrup 🍯🔥<br>
diverge, converge, repeat 🎢🎯♾️<br>
design is not engineering 👩‍🎨💖≠👷‍♂️🔧</p>

<p>thank you for coming to my ted talk 🎤🎀 and thank you, truly, for your feedback 🥹💕 it means the whole entire world to us 🌍💖✨</p>

<p>(⁠ ⁠˘⁠ ⁠³⁠˘⁠)⁠♥ 🎀🧁🍬🌸✨💕</p>
</body>
</html>
